{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06375","headline":"无尽上人东林禅居 · 李颀","name":"无尽上人东林禅居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"草堂每多暇，时谒山僧门。\n所对但羣木，终朝无一言。\n我心爱流水，此地临清源。\n含吐山上日，蔽亏松外村。\n孤峯隔身世，百衲老寒暄。\n禅户积朝雪，花龛来暮猿。\n顾余守耕稼，十载隐田园。\n萝筱慰舂汲，岩潭恣讨论。\n泄云岂知限，至道莫探元。\n且愿啓关锁，於焉微尚存。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李颀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06375.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06375","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}